<title>SWEDEN: Swedish repo allocates 12 bln SKR to market.</title>
<headline>Swedish repo allocates 12 bln SKR to market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday it allocated 12 billion crowns to the market in its weekly repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The one-week repo was set at an unchanged, fixed rate of 4.10 percent as expected by the market and will run from July 2 to July 9.</p>
<p>The operation replaces an operation that allocated 10.5 billion crowns to the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 40.27 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
